{
  "$defs": {
    "AvailabilityEvidenceGap": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一条 availability 证据缺口记录（ADR-0023 §2）：该 revision 的 `available_time` 已保守取\n`ingest_time`。\n\n证据缺口不是数据集级失败（roadmap Phase 1 验收 #18），但必须随 manifest 绑定：`table` +\n`revision_id` 指明哪个 revision，`quality_report_id` 指向记录该缺口的质量报告，`gap` 说明缺什么\n证据。稳定身份为 `(table, revision_id)`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "quality_report_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Quality Report Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "gap": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Gap",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "table",
        "revision_id",
        "quality_report_id",
        "gap"
      ],
      "title": "AvailabilityEvidenceGap",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DatasetRef": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "某个 Zone 的不可变数据快照引用（03-data.md §3）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "zone": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Zone"
        },
        "table": {
          "title": "Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Snapshot Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "time_range_start": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Time Range Start",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "time_range_end": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Time Range End",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "zone",
        "table",
        "snapshot_id",
        "time_range_start",
        "time_range_end"
      ],
      "title": "DatasetRef",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DegradedEpisodeKey": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "来源不提供稳定产品 ID 时的退化键：`(venue, instrument_type, symbol, tradable_from)`。\n\n`basis` 显式标注这是退化身份，不能假装有稳定 ID。`tradable_from` 是该 episode 第一段可交易区间的\n起点，因此 symbol 复用（同名、不同起点）自然形成不同 episode；无稳定 ID 的改名同样形成新\nepisode，由 `ListingRevision.renamed_from` 记录与旧 episode 的关联。起点被来源更正时也只能形成新\nepisode 并写质量事件，不猜测合并（ADR-0024「失败与恢复语义」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "basis": {
          "const": "degraded_symbol_start",
          "title": "Basis",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "venue": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/InstrumentType"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Symbol",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tradable_from": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Tradable From",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "basis",
        "venue",
        "instrument_type",
        "symbol",
        "tradable_from"
      ],
      "title": "DegradedEpisodeKey",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ExclusionReason": {
      "description": "候选 episode 被排除的原因（ADR-0024 §4、§5）。\n\n- `not_tradable`：`simulation_time` 不落在所选 listing revision 的任何可交易区间内（未上市、暂\n  停、已下架）；\n- `filtered`：被 spec 中的某条过滤规则排除（须给出 `filter_id`）。\n\ncompeting listing heads **不是**排除原因：它使整次构建 fail closed，不产生 manifest。",
      "enum": [
        "not_tradable",
        "filtered"
      ],
      "title": "ExclusionReason",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "InstrumentType": {
      "enum": [
        "spot",
        "perpetual",
        "future",
        "option"
      ],
      "title": "InstrumentType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PointInTimeSpec": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一次 PIT 查询的全部输入（ADR-0023 §5，03-data.md §7.5）。\n\n- `name` + `version`：本 spec 自身的身份；manifest 以 `name + SemVer + content_hash()`\n  绑定它（批次 B2）；\n- simulation：单点 `simulation_time`，**或** UTC 半开区间\n  `[simulation_start, simulation_end)`，二选一，区间两端必须同时给出且\n  `simulation_start < simulation_end`；\n- `knowledge_cutoff`：本机知识截止，与 simulation 独立（历史 backfill 时通常晚于 simulation）；\n- `snapshot_bindings`：读取的每张 Iceberg 表 `namespace.table → snapshot_id`，至少一项；\n- PIT 选择规则、availability policy、precedence policy、parser 版本的绑定，各自 `role` 确切、\n  同一字段内 `policy_id` 不得重复（同一 policy 两个版本即不确定），按 `policy_id` 规范排序。\n\nuniverse 绑定（ADR-0024）与 manifest 属批次 B2，不在本模型内。**诚实边界**：绑定能否解析到\n已登记且带证据的版本、snapshot 是否存在、所需表是否齐全，属未来执行器与 Registry\n（03-data.md §7.5 fail closed）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "simulation_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Simulation Time"
        },
        "simulation_start": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Simulation Start"
        },
        "simulation_end": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Simulation End"
        },
        "knowledge_cutoff": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Knowledge Cutoff",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "snapshot_bindings": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "minProperties": 1,
          "patternProperties": {
            "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "title": "Snapshot Bindings",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "point_in_time_binding": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
        },
        "availability_bindings": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Availability Bindings",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "precedence_bindings": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Precedence Bindings",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "parser_bindings": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Parser Bindings",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "version",
        "knowledge_cutoff",
        "snapshot_bindings",
        "point_in_time_binding",
        "availability_bindings",
        "precedence_bindings",
        "parser_bindings"
      ],
      "title": "PointInTimeSpec",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyBinding": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对一份版本化规则的绑定：`policy_id` + SemVer + 内容哈希（03-data.md §7.3）。\n\n`role` 区分 availability policy、precedence policy、PIT 选择规则与 parser 版本；使用处按字段\n要求确切的 `role`，因此 availability 与 precedence 绑定不能互相冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：只约束形状。该版本是否已登记、`policy_hash` 是否等于该版本的真实内容、\npolicy 是否带有已审阅的来源证据，属未来 Registry（03-data.md §7.3「标识符冻结 ≠ 数据可信」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyRole"
        },
        "policy_id": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Policy Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "policy_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Policy Hash",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "role",
        "policy_id",
        "version",
        "policy_hash"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyBinding",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyRole": {
      "description": "一条绑定所约束的规则类别；同一形状的绑定按类别分别使用、不可互换。",
      "enum": [
        "availability",
        "precedence",
        "point_in_time",
        "parser"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyRole",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "SelectedRevisionLineage": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个选中 Canonical revision 的来源链：Canonical revision → Raw row revision → Raw source\npayload revision。\n\n第三跳是通用的来源 hop：首切片归档路径中 source 即归档文件 revision\n（`raw.binance_spot_archives`）；D3 REST 补尾的 Raw 响应载荷同样用这一跳表达（ADR-0022）。\n契约只表达 hop 的形状，具体 source 类型与其内容由未来 Collector / 表实现证明。\n\n表名为 Iceberg `namespace.table`：`canonical_table` 必须在 `canonical` namespace，`raw_table` 与\n`source_table` 必须在 `raw` namespace（03-data.md §7.1）。稳定身份为\n`(canonical_table, canonical_revision_id)`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "canonical_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Canonical Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "canonical_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Canonical Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Raw Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Raw Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Source Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Source Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "canonical_table",
        "canonical_revision_id",
        "raw_table",
        "raw_revision_id",
        "source_table",
        "source_revision_id"
      ],
      "title": "SelectedRevisionLineage",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "StableEpisodeKey": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "以 venue 原生稳定产品 ID 标识的 episode：`(venue, instrument_type, venue_product_id)`。\n\nsymbol 改名仍属同一 episode（symbol 不在键内，由各 revision 的 `instrument.symbol` 记录变化）。\n`instrument_type` 在键内：venue 的产品 ID 命名空间可能按市场类型区分。\n\n`basis` 是来源声明：产品 ID 的字符串值可以恰好等于某时刻的 symbol，契约不从字符串相等推断冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：来源是否真的提供了稳定 ID、该 ID 是否真的跨改名不变，属未来 Collector / Registry /\n质量证据，契约层无法证明。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "basis": {
          "const": "stable_product_id",
          "title": "Basis",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "venue": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/InstrumentType"
        },
        "venue_product_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue Product Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "basis",
        "venue",
        "instrument_type",
        "venue_product_id"
      ],
      "title": "StableEpisodeKey",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "UniverseExclusion": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "排除原因清单中的一项：episode + 所依据的 listing revision + 明确原因。\n\n`reason = filtered` 时必须给出 `filter_id`，其它原因不得给出。生效区间规则同 `UniverseMember`。\n**诚实边界**：`filter_id` 是否存在于被绑定的 spec 中，需要 spec 本身，属未来执行器 / Registry。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "episode": {
          "discriminator": {
            "mapping": {
              "degraded_symbol_start": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey",
              "stable_product_id": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
            },
            "propertyName": "basis"
          },
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Episode"
        },
        "listing_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Listing Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "reason": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ExclusionReason"
        },
        "filter_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Filter Id"
        },
        "effective_from": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Effective From"
        },
        "effective_until": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Effective Until"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "episode",
        "listing_revision_id",
        "reason"
      ],
      "title": "UniverseExclusion",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "UniverseMember": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "最终成员清单中的一项：episode + 决定它入选的 listing revision（PIT 选出的唯一 head）。\n\n单点 simulation 时不带生效区间；simulation 为区间时必须带 UTC 半开生效区间\n`[effective_from, effective_until)`，且落在 simulation 区间内（由 manifest 校验）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "episode": {
          "discriminator": {
            "mapping": {
              "degraded_symbol_start": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey",
              "stable_product_id": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
            },
            "propertyName": "basis"
          },
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/StableEpisodeKey"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DegradedEpisodeKey"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Episode"
        },
        "listing_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Listing Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "effective_from": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Effective From"
        },
        "effective_until": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Effective Until"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "episode",
        "listing_revision_id"
      ],
      "title": "UniverseMember",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "UniverseSpecBinding": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "manifest 对 `UniverseSelectionSpec` 的专用绑定：`name + SemVer + spec_hash`（ADR-0024 §5 /\n§6）。\n\n不是 `Ref`，不携带 `Kind`；与 `PolicyBinding` 形状不同、不可互换。\n\n**诚实边界**：该版本是否已登记、`spec_hash` 是否等于真实内容，属未来 Registry；持有 spec 本身时\n可用 `binds()` 本地核对。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.3.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "spec_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Spec Hash",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "version",
        "spec_hash"
      ],
      "title": "UniverseSpecBinding",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Zone": {
      "description": "数据分层（03-data.md §3）。",
      "enum": [
        "raw",
        "canonical",
        "feature",
        "state",
        "event",
        "outcome",
        "research_dataset"
      ],
      "title": "Zone",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一份 Research Dataset 的审计清单（ADR-0023 §6、ADR-0024 §6、03-data.md §3 / §7.5）。\n\n**全部字段必填，清单字段没有默认值**：缺字段即拒绝；成员、排除、lineage 与证据缺口清单可以显式为\n空（某时点可能全部入选、全部排除或没有候选），但不能靠\"省略\"得到空清单。\n\n- `dataset`：该 Research Dataset 自身的 `DatasetRef`，`zone` 必须是 `research_dataset`，`table`\n  为 `namespace.table` 且不得出现在上游绑定中（自身与上游不混淆）；\n- `point_in_time`：B1 `PointInTimeSpec` 全文——上游 snapshot（`snapshot_bindings`，表名天然去\n  重）、simulation 单点或区间、`knowledge_cutoff`、PIT / availability / precedence / parser 绑定\n  的**唯一来源**。manifest 不另存任何 cutoff、simulation 或 policy 字段，因此同一 manifest 内不\n  可能出现两套互相矛盾的值；其 `name + SemVer + content_hash()` 即 PIT spec 绑定。上游必须包含\n  listing 历史表 `canonical.instrument_listings` 与质量报告表 `quality.data_quality_reports`；\n- `universe_spec`：`UniverseSpecBinding`（`name + SemVer + content hash`，不是 `Ref`）；\n- `members` / `exclusions`：稳定身份为 `(episode 键, effective_from)`，规范排序；单点 simulation\n  时同一 episode 至多出现一次，区间 simulation 时同一 episode 的全部生效区间（成员与排除合计）互\n  不重叠，且都落在 simulation 区间内——同一 episode 在同一时刻不能既是成员又被排除；\n- listing revision 引用：每个 member / exclusion 的 `listing_revision_id` 只能属于一个 episode\n  （同一 ID 可在同一 episode 的多个不重叠生效区间中重复出现，但不得被两个 episode 认领，与 B1\n  `RevisionGraph` 的 revision ID 归属规则一致），且必须在 `lineage` 中有\n  `canonical_table == canonical.instrument_listings` 的来源链——决定成员资格的 listing revision\n  不得悬空，其它 Canonical 表的 lineage 不能冒充；\n- `lineage`：选中 revision 的来源链，按 `(canonical_table, canonical_revision_id)` 去重并排序，\n  所涉表都必须有上游 snapshot；\n- `quality_report_ids`：引用的质量报告，至少一项，去重并排序；\n- `evidence_gaps`：availability 证据缺口，按 `(table, revision_id)` 去重并排序，`table` 必须有上\n  游 snapshot，`quality_report_id` 必须在 `quality_report_ids` 中（可证明的悬空引用被拒绝）。\n\n**诚实边界**：这是审计契约，**不**证明被绑定的 snapshot / 版本在 Registry 中存在、哈希等于真实内\n容、成员清单确实由 spec + snapshot + 两个截止按 maximal-head 算法重建、逐行 PIT 正确、lineage 是\n完整闭包、`dataset_snapshots` 已包含自身 `DatasetRef`，也不证明 Runner 会强制接收它——这些是 B3 /\nF / Registry / 未来 Runner 的义务。已发布的 `DatasetRef` 与 `ReproducibilityTuple` 字段不变。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.3.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "dataset": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/DatasetRef"
    },
    "point_in_time": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PointInTimeSpec"
    },
    "universe_spec": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/UniverseSpecBinding"
    },
    "members": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/UniverseMember"
      },
      "title": "Members",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "exclusions": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/UniverseExclusion"
      },
      "title": "Exclusions",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "lineage": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/SelectedRevisionLineage"
      },
      "title": "Lineage",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "quality_report_ids": {
      "items": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Quality Report Ids",
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true
    },
    "evidence_gaps": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/AvailabilityEvidenceGap"
      },
      "title": "Evidence Gaps",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "dataset",
    "point_in_time",
    "universe_spec",
    "members",
    "exclusions",
    "lineage",
    "quality_report_ids",
    "evidence_gaps"
  ],
  "title": "ResearchDatasetManifest",
  "type": "object"
}
